From b3018d871d956652166c24d335f0eefaa10c754f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cleanup <cleanup@local>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:09:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Shark-OS network cleanup: driver split, httpd stall fix,
 comments stripped

Single squash of the cleanup branch, based directly on origin/main.
Apply with:
  git fetch /path/to/Shark-OS-net-cleanup.bundle cleanup
  git reset --hard FETCH_HEAD

Contents:
- src/net/drivers/: rtl8139, pcnet, e1000, r8169, ne2000, virtio_net, one file each
- include/netdev.h driver interface + registry, include/drivers/*.h per driver
- include/net.h self-contained (fixes the net/netdev.h include error)
- tcp_server: connection reaper, keepalives, absolute send deadline, truthful window
- httpd: header timeout, chunked bodies, 431, listener self-heal
- comments removed from all C/H except the vendored src/doom/engine
- build artefacts untracked and ignored
